docs {
  # GET /apis/artworks/art-curators/1/ — Retrieve an art curator

  Returns a single art curator by ID. Requires `Authorization: Token`.

  ## Status codes

  - `200 OK` — success
  - `401 Unauthorized` — missing or invalid token
  - `404 Not Found` — art curator does not exist

  ## Response (200)

  ```json
  {
    "id": 1,
    "slug": "maria-rodriguez",
    "is_active": true,
    "sort_order": 0,
    "created_at": "2026-08-17T10:00:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-17T10:00:00Z",
    "name": "María Rodríguez",
    "email": "maria@example.com",
    "website": "https://example.com",
    "photo": "https://enredarte-dashboard.localhost/media/curators/maria.webp",
    "translations": {
      "es": { "bio": "Curadora independiente." },
      "en": { "bio": "Independent curator." }
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Error (401)

  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Invalid token.",
    "data": {}
  }
  ```

  ## Error (404)

  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Not found.",
    "data": {}
  }
  ```
}
